            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">War: The Decline of Mass Violence</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The Long Peace since 1945</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"380\" fill=\"#2d2d44\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2012 Global Deaths (illustrative)</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"260\" width=\"100\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"490\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Diabetes</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"515\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1.5M</text><rect x=\"320\" y=\"350\" width=\"100\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"490\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Suicide</text><text x=\"370\" y=\"515\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">800K</text><rect x=\"490\" y=\"385\" width=\"100\" height=\"75\" fill=\"#ec4899\"/><text x=\"540\" y=\"490\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Violence</text><text x=\"540\" y=\"515\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">620K</text><rect x=\"660\" y=\"260\" width=\"100\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"490\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sugar</text><text x=\"710\" y=\"515\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3M plus</text><rect x=\"830\" y=\"320\" width=\"100\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#6366f1\"/><text x=\"880\" y=\"490\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Road acc</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"515\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1.25M</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"580\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#2d2d44\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"620\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Drivers of the Long Peace</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"670\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Nuclear deterrence makes total war suicidal for major powers</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"705\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Trade interdependence, knowledge economies suffer when isolated</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"740\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\">International institutions (UN, WTO) reduce conflict incentives</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"775\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Borders have stabilized, territorial expansion no longer rational</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"830\" width=\"940\" height=\"170\" fill=\"#2d2d44\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"870\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Caveats Harari Acknowledges</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"910\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Syria, Ukraine, Gaza, Sudan: war has not vanished</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"945\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">But these are regional exceptions to a long-term decline</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"980\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">A reversal remains possible, the trend is not destiny</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Mass violence has declined enough that sugar now kills more people than war"
